<p>AI Overview
        Agentic AI is an exciting topic where artificial intelligence goes beyond simple text or image generation to autonomously plan, use tools, and complete multi-step tasks on its own.
What is Agentic AI?
 Autonomous Action: Unlike standard chatbots that just answer questions when prompted, agents can break a large goal into smaller steps and execute them.
 Tool Use: These systems can browse the web, write and run computer code, open apps, and interact with external software to solve problems.
 Self-Correction: Agents check their own work, fix errors in their code or logic, and try a different approach if the first attempt fails.
